  "details": "If your homeworld (First world to load into) is a SDK3 world and you join a SDK2 world you cannot pick up any pickups that are dynamically spawned as the game client will remove the pickup component from those.\nIf your homeworld is a SDK2 world then this issue does not occur.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_83a1f306-f8e5-4057-896e-14ad8923d985\nThis is a SDK2 world that will spawn a cube with a pickup component for testing purposes.\n\nUPDATE: This also breaks the flying machine in worlds like treehouse in the shade.",
